\section{Troubleshooting Report: Route System Failure}

During final system synchronization, a critical parsing error occurred in \texttt{routes/web.php}, preventing Laravel from bootstrapping.

\textbf{Error Description:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Syntax error: unexpected token \texttt{=> collect()}
    \item Corrupted route closure in wishlist and admin route section
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Root Cause:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Accidental merging of Blade/controller logic into route definition file
    \item Incomplete deletion of a wishlist route closure
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Resolution:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Removed corrupted route fragment
    \item Restored clean admin route group structure
    \item Rebuilt wishlist route as standalone closure
    \item Cleared Laravel caches using \texttt{route:clear}, \texttt{config:clear}, and \texttt{cache:clear}
\end{itemize}

